        "title": "Ai nkhuan ne guang daimei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ai nkhuan e Guang daihmei ,",
            "Kandih rianra zinghmei khou,",
            "Damlou mei salem namdaih,",
            "Gaimei tei ning thukge,",
            "Kandih rianra mei le zingmei bam khou bamsini,",
            "Zauzian lou na phuguangmei",
            "Puta ningtan makge.",
            "",
            "Tingkao Eden than gaimei tei,",
            "Rianra rian riumei makpui ram",
            "He! Tabui nung guang tang ni cho?",
            "Nang ting saeng guang daime su pui ram gaimei.",
            "",
            "2. Na guang o kanlou mei pu,",
            "Rih dai e kandi khou hei,",
            "Nang zei ruina kanlou mei",
            "Guai lung gei na kap e",
            "Kandih khou hei rian ra loupui bam e kalvary ;",
            "Houmuhmei guay guang e nang",
            "Ta adou mei nun tei.",
            "",
            "3. He! Buithang cho kanloumei?",
            "Zion luangbut gaimei tei,",
            "Paapguai tei nthan diu khang,",
            "Zeitei luangkei lou the ,",
            "Paapguai maanpui bam e tingsaeng namdai gaimei khou,",
            "Kanloumei guai gaina bam,",
            "Puiram gaimei khou tei.",
            "",
            "4. Hei kandih hei maan puni,",
            "Tikgun daimei guai hei ni,",
            "Kanloumei pu ruina khuam",
            "Kariu nimei guaita",
            "Kamei zian mei nun rui tikgun daimei lapuni",
            "Kamei nzianloumei thuan",
            "Ku o halleluijah."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
